@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 10

title Sơ Đồ Tuần Tự: Hoàn Tất Phiên Sạc và Cập Nhật Tồn Kho Năng Lượng (Sequence Diagram)

actor "Người Dùng / Nhân Viên\n(Operator)" as User
participant "ChargingPanel\n(Frontend)" as UI
participant "ChargingSessionController" as Controller
participant "ChargingSessionService" as ChargeService
participant "VehicleEnergyInventoryService" as EnergyService
participant "VehicleEnergyInventoryRepository" as InvRepo
participant "VehicleEnergyTransactionRepository" as TxRepo
database "MySQL Database" as DB

User -> UI : Nhấn "Dừng & Hoàn Tất Phiên Sạc"
activate UI

UI -> Controller : POST /api/charging/sessions/{id}/complete
activate Controller

Controller -> ChargeService : completeChargingSession(sessionId, principal)
activate ChargeService

ChargeService -> DB : Cập nhật ChargingSession (status = COMPLETED, endedAt, energyDeliveredKwh)
activate DB
DB --> ChargeService : OK
deactivate DB

ChargeService -> EnergyService : recordChargingSessionCompletion(session)
activate EnergyService

EnergyService -> TxRepo : existsBySourceReferenceIdAndTransactionType(session.id, CHARGING_INFLOW)
activate TxRepo
TxRepo --> EnergyService : false (Chưa từng ghi nhận - Tránh trùng lặp)
deactivate TxRepo

EnergyService -> InvRepo : findByVehicleId(vehicle.id)
activate InvRepo
InvRepo --> EnergyService : VehicleEnergyInventory (prevEnergy, prevCost, prevAvgCost)
deactivate InvRepo

note over EnergyService
  Tính toán vật lý & tài chính:
  1. storedEnergy = deliveredEnergy * 0.90 (Hiệu suất sạc 90%)
  2. energyLoss = deliveredEnergy - storedEnergy
  3. energyValueToAdd = storedEnergy * tariff
  4. newEnergy = prevEnergy + storedEnergy
  5. newValue = prevValue + energyValueToAdd
  6. newAvgCost = newValue / newEnergy (Giá bình quân gia quyền mới)
end note

EnergyService -> InvRepo : save(inventory: updated energy, value, weightedAvgCost)
activate InvRepo
InvRepo -> DB : UPDATE vehicle_energy_inventories SET available_energy_kwh = ?, total_inventory_cost = ?, weighted_avg_cost_per_kwh = ? WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB --> InvRepo : OK
deactivate DB
InvRepo --> EnergyService : Saved Inventory
deactivate InvRepo

EnergyService -> TxRepo : save(new VehicleEnergyTransaction(CHARGING_INFLOW, +storedEnergy, +cost, newAvgCost))
activate TxRepo
TxRepo -> DB : INSERT INTO vehicle_energy_transactions (...)
activate DB
DB --> TxRepo : OK
deactivate DB
TxRepo --> EnergyService : Saved Transaction
deactivate TxRepo

EnergyService --> ChargeService : Updated Inventory
deactivate EnergyService

ChargeService --> Controller : ChargingSessionResponse
deactivate ChargeService

Controller --> UI : HTTP 200 OK (ChargingSessionResponse JSON)
deactivate Controller

UI --> User : Cập nhật % pin hiển thị và bảng tồn kho năng lượng 3D
deactivate UI

@enduml
